@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `law08-vintage`
IMPORT `law08-nouns`

-- Chuong IV (Dieu 124-143): insurance agents, insurance brokers, providers of ancillary insurance services.
-- Law 139/2025/QH15 touches this Chuong at: Dieu 127(1) (Dieu 1(9)), Dieu 133(1)(a) and (4) (repealed, Dieu 2(7)),
-- Dieu 134 (replaced, Dieu 1(10)), Dieu 138 (new khoan 3a, Dieu 1(11)), Dieu 143 (repealed from V3, Dieu 2(8)).
-- Each is a dated arm below.

§ `Chuong IV, Muc 1: Dai ly bao hiem`

§§ `Dieu 124 and 125: the agent and its conditions`

@@q 2691 2694
@ref Dieu 124 (src:2691-2694)
`Dieu 124 — an agent is an organisation or individual authorised by an insurer, a foreign non-life branch or a mutual organisation under an agency contract (a definition)` MEANS
    "Agent: authorised under a contract."

@@q 2696 2700
@ref Dieu 125 (src:2696-2700)
GIVEN a IS AN `An individual agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 125(1): the individual meets the conditions to act as an agent` a MEANS
        a's `is a Vietnamese citizen resident in Vietnam`
    AND a's `has full civil act capacity`
    AND a's `holds an agent certificate suited to the types of insurance`

@@q 2701 2710
@ref Dieu 125 (src:2701-2710)
GIVEN a IS AN `An organisation agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 125(2): the organisation meets the conditions to act as an agent` a MEANS
        a's `is lawfully established and operating in Vietnam`
    AND a's `has registered the business line of insurance agency under the Law on Enterprises`
    AND ((NOT a's `is in a conditional line`) OR a's `is in a conditional line and holds the licence, certificate or approval that covers insurance agency`)
    AND a's `its staff who act as agents meet the individual conditions`
    AND a's `meets the staffing and other conditions the Government sets`

@@q 2713 2720
@ref Dieu 125 (src:2713-2720)
GIVEN a IS AN `An individual agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 125(3)(b): the individual may not make or perform an agency contract` a MEANS
    a's `is being prosecuted for a crime` OR a's `is serving a prison sentence` OR a's `is serving a ban on practising in a field related to insurance`

GIVEN a IS AN `An organisation agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 125(3)(a): the organisation may not make or perform an agency contract` a MEANS
    a's `is a commercial legal person being prosecuted for a crime` OR a's `is suspended for a time or for good, or banned from business related to insurance`

§§ `Dieu 126: the agency contract`

@@q 2722 2733
@ref Dieu 126 (src:2722-2733)
GIVEN c IS A `The contract of an agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 126: the agency contract states the essential contents` c MEANS
        c's `states the name and address of the agent`
    AND c's `states the name and head office address of the insurer, branch or mutual organisation`
    AND c's `states the rights and obligations of both sides`
    AND c's `states the content and scope of the agency`
    AND c's `states commission, bonus and support, if any`
    AND c's `states the term of the contract`
    AND c's `states the way of resolving disputes`

§§ `Dieu 127: principles of acting as an agent`

-- Dieu 127(1), first paragraph. V1: an individual may not at once be an agent of two insurers operating in the same
-- type of insurance, or of two mutual organisations. From V2 (Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(9)): an agent of a life insurer may
-- not be an agent of another life insurer; of a non-life insurer or foreign non-life branch, not of another such;
-- of a health insurer, not of another; of a mutual organisation, not of another. The two texts part for a life insurer
-- that also carries on health insurance (Dieu 63(3)(a)): V1 bars it from sharing an agent with a health insurer, V2 does not.
@@q 2734 2743
@@qa 222 233
@ref Dieu 127 (src:2734-2743; src:law139-2025-qh15:222-233)
GIVEN e IS A `Two engagements of an individual agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` e MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN `the two principals are of the same kind` (e's `first principal`) (e's `second principal`)
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN     (    `the principal is an insurer or foreign non-life branch` (e's `first principal`)
                     AND `the principal is an insurer or foreign non-life branch` (e's `second principal`)
                     AND `the lists share a type` (e's `types of insurance the first principal carries on`) (e's `types of insurance the second principal carries on`))
                OR (    e's `first principal` EQUALS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`
                    AND e's `second principal` EQUALS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`)
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

GIVEN k IS A `A kind of insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the principal is an insurer or foreign non-life branch` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a life insurer`                          THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a non-life insurer`                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a health insurer`                        THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`  THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF `A type of insurance`
      ys IS A LIST OF `A type of insurance`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the lists share a type` xs ys MEANS
    any (GIVEN x YIELD elem x ys) xs

GIVEN a IS A `A kind of insurer`
      b IS A `A kind of insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the two principals are of the same kind` a b MEANS
        (a EQUALS `a life insurer` AND b EQUALS `a life insurer`)
    OR  (    (a EQUALS `a non-life insurer` OR a EQUALS `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`)
         AND (b EQUALS `a non-life insurer` OR b EQUALS `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`))
    OR  (a EQUALS `a health insurer` AND b EQUALS `a health insurer`)
    OR  (a EQUALS `a microinsurance mutual organisation` AND b EQUALS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`)

@@q 2744 2749
@ref Dieu 127 (src:2744-2749)
GIVEN e IS A `Two engagements of an organisation agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 127(2): the organisation may be the agent of both principals` e MEANS
    e's `the first principal agreed in writing to the second engagement`

@@q 2750 2759
@ref Dieu 127 (src:2750-2759)
GIVEN p IS AN `An agent's practice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 127(3)-(4): the agent practises as the Law requires` p MEANS
    p's `acts only on products the agent was trained on` AND p's `the agent's data is registered and kept current in the insurance database`

GIVEN p IS AN `An agent's practice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 127(5): the individual must pass the examination for a new certificate before acting` p MEANS
    p's `continuous years without acting as an agent` AT LEAST 3

§§ `Dieu 128 and 129: rights and duties`

@@q 2763 2780
@ref Dieu 128 (src:2763-2780)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Dieu 128(1)(c) and (2)(dd): the maximum commission, bonus and support the Minister of Finance allows` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 128 limits commission, bonus and support to the maximum the Minister of Finance sets; the Minister's circular is not among the sources"

`Dieu 128(1)-(2) — rights and duties of the insurer, branch or mutual organisation in agency (lists: organise the agents, recruit, fix commission within the cap, hold deposits, require premium collected, supervise; answer for the agents, train them, guide them, pay them, return deposits, answer for contracts the agent arranged, accept supervision, not hinder the agent, report, register agents in the database) (no rule evaluated beyond the cap above)` MEANS
    "Lists of rights and duties."

@@q 2816 2866
@ref Dieu 129 (src:2816-2866)
`Dieu 129(1)-(2) — rights and duties of an agent (lists: choose the principal, be given information, earn commission, have the deposit returned; perform the contract, give a deposit if agreed, meet financial duties, advise and explain fully, attend training, accept supervision, indemnify the insurer for the agent's breach, keep standards, keep client secrets) (no rule evaluated beyond the conduct tested below)` MEANS
    "Lists of rights and duties."

@@q 2867 2880
@ref Dieu 129 (src:2867-2880)
GIVEN c IS A `The conduct of an agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 129(3): the agent's conduct is prohibited` c MEANS
        c's `gave false information or advertising on the insurer's content or scope or the terms, harming the policyholder`
    OR  c's `prevented the policyholder from giving information or urged the policyholder not to declare it`
    OR  c's `took customers by obstructing, luring, bribing or threatening staff or customers of an insurer, agent or broker`
    OR  c's `urged a customer to cancel a contract in force`

GIVEN c IS A `The conduct of an agent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 129(2)(d): the agent filled in information for the policyholder without consent` c MEANS
    c's `filled in information for the policyholder without the policyholder's consent`

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 129(4): the Minister of Finance's rules on advising, introducing and offering products` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 129(4) delegates Dieu 129(2)(d) to the Minister of Finance; the Minister's circular is not among the sources"

§§ `Dieu 130: agent certificates`

@@q 2883 2886
@ref Dieu 130 (src:2883-2886)
GIVETH A LIST OF `A kind of agent certificate`
`Dieu 130(1): the kinds of agent certificate` MEANS
    LIST `a life insurance agent certificate`, `a non-life insurance agent certificate`, `a health insurance agent certificate`

@@q 2887 2900
@ref Dieu 130 (src:2887-2900)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 130(3): the Minister of Finance's rules on agent certificates` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 130(3) delegates the kinds of certificate, the training content and the examination, issue, withdrawal and exchange to the Minister of Finance; the Minister's circular is not among the sources"

`Dieu 130(2) — the training content of an agent certificate: general knowledge and principles, ethics, rights and duties, Vietnamese insurance law, skills (a list of syllabus items; no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "Five syllabus items."

§ `Chuong IV, Muc 2: Doanh nghiep moi gioi bao hiem`

§§ `Dieu 131 and 132: content and principles`

@@qb 28 31
@ref Dieu 131 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:28-31)
`Dieu 131 — a broker's activities: primary brokerage and reinsurance brokerage; ancillary insurance services; other work related to the contract at the buyer's request (a list; no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "Three kinds of activity."

@@qb 33 38
@ref Dieu 132 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:33-38)
GIVEN `the broker agreed with the customer in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
